  "_fuseComment": "#471 (FEAT-102, lot J1): the fusion of identical groups (design.md rule 4, D5), as the families_transform migration does it in SQL and as a manual merge (POST /api/products/merge) does it again in TypeScript (planGroupFusion, shared/review.ts) — read by api/tests/lib/review.test.ts. Units are listed in creation order; fields left out are: productId p1, cellarId c1, purchasePrice 20, purchasedAt 2026-01-15, bottleSize, cigarsPerBox, estimatedValue, purchasePlace and location null, quantity 1, intact (closed, no level), not in the trash, not written off, needsReview false, no slot, counted in no inventory session. `fused` lists the groups that fuse, survivor (the oldest) first, with what the survivor then holds.",
